WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.836
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.106 --> 00:03.442
[♪ theme song playing]

3
00:03.525 --> 00:04.651
PARK MINJAE'S LIST

4
00:04.735 --> 00:06.028
START DATING...

5
00:36.725 --> 00:41.063
BETWEEN STEPS

6
00:41.688 --> 00:43.899
CHARACTERS, PLACES, ORGANIZATIONS, AND EVENTS IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

7
00:43.982 --> 00:45.609
THIS DRAMA CONTAINS SENSITIVE CONTENT

8
00:47.361 --> 00:49.363
[Youjin sobbing]

9
01:01.500 --> 01:02.626
[♪ emotional music playing]

10
01:02.709 --> 01:03.710
Once...

11
01:04.961 --> 01:07.089
I swallow something, I never spit it out.

12
01:10.592 --> 01:13.261
I'd never spit it back out, even if it burned me alive.

13
01:17.766 --> 01:19.309
There's no going back.

14
01:21.144 --> 01:22.813
I have to see it through to the end.

15
01:27.359 --> 01:28.527
Do you still want this?

16
01:56.388 --> 01:57.389
Let's go.

17
02:49.357 --> 02:51.359
[♪ music fades]

18
03:00.368 --> 03:01.787
-[knocking at door] -[Minjae] Youjin.

19
03:02.329 --> 03:03.330
Yes?

20
03:03.830 --> 03:04.831
What is it?

21
03:06.458 --> 03:09.419
[Minjae] I left your clothes by the door.

22
03:09.503 --> 03:11.296
Put them on when you come out.

23
03:11.379 --> 03:12.464
I'll be in my room.

24
03:13.256 --> 03:14.257
Okay.

25
03:28.522 --> 03:29.731
[sighs]

26
03:29.814 --> 03:31.358
EPISODE 6

27
03:31.441 --> 03:33.193
-Mmm... Done showering? -Yeah.

28
03:33.276 --> 03:34.653
-Hot water working okay? -Yeah.

29
03:34.736 --> 03:36.154
You don't want to catch a cold.

30
03:36.238 --> 03:37.572
And your hair.

31
03:37.656 --> 03:39.658
Make sure you dry it completely.

32
03:39.741 --> 03:41.826
I dried most of it.

33
03:41.910 --> 03:42.911
-You did? -Yeah.

34
03:42.994 --> 03:43.995
Oh...

35
03:44.538 --> 03:45.997
Right, come, come here.

36
03:46.081 --> 03:47.165
Come here.

37
03:47.249 --> 03:48.333
Sit here.

38
03:49.042 --> 03:50.043
[refrigerator door opens]

39
03:52.045 --> 03:53.171
[refrigerator door closes]

40
03:55.507 --> 03:56.591
Drink this.

41
03:56.675 --> 03:58.093
-It'll warm you up. -Thank you.

42
03:59.970 --> 04:00.971
[Minjae mumbles]

43
04:14.526 --> 04:16.611
Have some more. You need to warm up.

44
04:16.695 --> 04:18.071
-Hmm? -[Youjin] Okay.

45
04:29.916 --> 04:30.917
[Minjae] It's on...

46
04:31.001 --> 04:32.002
-Huh? -[Minjae] You got it on your face.

47
04:32.919 --> 04:33.920
Mmm...

48
04:34.963 --> 04:36.423
Are you done?

49
04:36.506 --> 04:37.507
[Youjin] Yes.

50
04:40.510 --> 04:41.720
If you're done, let's go.

51
04:41.803 --> 04:43.054
What?

52
04:43.138 --> 04:46.391
I can't seem to get a taxi because of the rain. This...

53
04:46.474 --> 04:48.643
I don't mind staying the night here.

54
04:48.727 --> 04:49.728
[Minjae] Hmm?

55
04:51.146 --> 04:53.940
My family said I could sleep over tonight.

56
04:55.650 --> 04:59.779
That's because they thought you'd be watching the meteor shower

57
04:59.863 --> 05:01.907
and studying with your labmates.

58
05:02.991 --> 05:05.827
You can't just go spending the night at some guy's place.

59
05:05.911 --> 05:08.788
When did I ever say I was staying at just some guy's place?

60
05:08.872 --> 05:09.873
-[cellphone vibrates] -What do you...

61
05:09.956 --> 05:12.334
We got one. Let's go.

62
05:12.417 --> 05:13.877
-[Youjin] Huh? -We got a taxi.

63
05:14.461 --> 05:15.462
Come on.

64
05:15.545 --> 05:17.464
-But... -Right, don't forget your clothes.

65
05:20.550 --> 05:21.551
[Youjin] But...

66
05:22.594 --> 05:23.762
Do you have everything?

67
05:25.722 --> 05:26.723
[Youjin] Hello.

68
06:22.529 --> 06:23.530
[Minjae] Aren't you getting out?

69
06:23.613 --> 06:25.615
[blinker ticking]

70
06:26.157 --> 06:27.283
[seatbelt clicks]

71
06:27.367 --> 06:28.368
[Youjin] Have a good night.

72
06:38.628 --> 06:39.921
-What... hey. -[Youjin exclaims]

73
06:40.547 --> 06:42.424
What if someone sees us?

74
06:42.507 --> 06:43.675
It's your neighborhood.

75
06:43.758 --> 06:45.760
Who's going to see us? There's no one around.

76
06:45.844 --> 06:47.846
[indistinct chatter]

77
06:49.347 --> 06:50.348
[Minjae] There they are.

78
06:58.606 --> 06:59.607
Mmm...

79
07:00.275 --> 07:01.276
Bye.

80
07:02.777 --> 07:03.778
Go on in.

81
07:04.446 --> 07:05.864
[Youjin] Call me when you get home.

82
07:06.865 --> 07:07.991
Okay, will do.

83
07:10.827 --> 07:11.828
Wait.

84
07:12.787 --> 07:14.205
Youjin.

85
07:17.751 --> 07:22.005
How about we don't tell anyone that we're dating for now?

86
07:26.259 --> 07:31.264
I mean, I'm getting my PhD by the end of this semester, so just until then.

87
07:31.347 --> 07:32.557
Just for the time being.

88
07:39.105 --> 07:41.733
We don't have to keep it a secret, though.

89
07:43.777 --> 07:45.570
We don't have to, do we?

90
07:47.405 --> 07:48.907
Well, that's not what I mean...

91
07:51.534 --> 07:53.286
So you want to tell everyone about it?

92
07:54.537 --> 07:56.748
Everyone in the lab?

93
07:56.831 --> 07:59.918
Taeho, Chansoo, Hangyeol, and Kim Sejin?

94
08:02.879 --> 08:04.881
[dog barking in distance]

95
08:06.257 --> 08:08.843
Let's just keep it from everyone else for the time being.

96
08:12.180 --> 08:13.473
Hmm?

97
08:22.690 --> 08:23.691
[sighs]

98
08:25.860 --> 08:27.946
[grunts]

99
08:29.322 --> 08:31.950
[breathing heavily]

100
08:32.742 --> 08:34.577
[coughs]

101
08:34.661 --> 08:36.204
[clears throat]

102
08:39.332 --> 08:40.750
[sniffles]

103
08:45.004 --> 08:46.506
[sighs, sniffles]

104
08:46.589 --> 08:47.590
[exhales]

105
08:53.805 --> 08:55.515
[groans softly]

106
08:55.598 --> 08:56.724
I'm so tired.

107
08:57.559 --> 08:58.560
[sighs]

108
08:59.394 --> 09:01.396
[footsteps approaching]

109
09:05.733 --> 09:07.735
[♪ comical music playing]

110
09:40.685 --> 09:41.686
[Sejin] Oh...

111
09:41.769 --> 09:42.770
[Minjae] Hey.

112
09:43.229 --> 09:44.647
-What? -[Minjae] Huh?

113
09:45.899 --> 09:47.483
What are you doing here?

114
09:49.402 --> 09:52.030
Well, you guys said you'd be watching the stars here,

115
09:52.113 --> 09:53.489
so I came to check on you.

116
09:53.573 --> 09:54.574
Why did you come up?

117
09:59.078 --> 10:00.288
[Sejin yawns]

118
10:00.371 --> 10:02.582
Well, we were waiting to see the meteor shower...

119
10:02.665 --> 10:03.875
[Minjae] Yeah.

120
10:03.958 --> 10:06.544
[sighs] ...but then it suddenly started pouring.

121
10:06.628 --> 10:08.880
Yeah, it came out of nowhere.

122
10:09.672 --> 10:11.674
I was worried about you guys, so I came over.

123
10:15.511 --> 10:19.140
You can always catch the next one, so don't be too disappointed.

124
10:20.183 --> 10:22.185
[Sejin] Well... I guess.

125
10:22.685 --> 10:23.686
[Minjae] Yeah.

126
10:24.938 --> 10:27.106
And when you're done, clean up after yourselves.

127
10:27.190 --> 10:28.524
Where are the trash bags?

128
10:28.608 --> 10:30.235
No, this isn't it.

129
10:30.318 --> 10:31.611
Where are the trash bags?

130
10:31.694 --> 10:33.279
Leave it. I'll do it.

131
10:33.363 --> 10:36.324
Man, this is... Where are the trash bags?

132
10:36.407 --> 10:37.492
Just leave it.

133
10:39.994 --> 10:41.037
Right.

134
10:41.537 --> 10:42.789
[Minjae] What? What is it?

135
10:42.872 --> 10:44.832
Where did Lim Youjin go? Have you seen her?

136
10:44.916 --> 10:46.334
-Where did she go? -[Minjae] Youjin?

137
10:46.417 --> 10:49.254
-She wasn't downstairs either. -[Minjae] She left. She went home.

138
10:51.005 --> 10:53.383
I saw her take a taxi earlier.

139
10:55.051 --> 10:56.177
She went home?

140
10:56.261 --> 10:59.681
Yeah, I mean... It was just pouring earlier.

141
10:59.764 --> 11:02.892
She probably figured she wouldn't be able to see anything, and left.

142
11:03.309 --> 11:04.477
Wow.

143
11:05.311 --> 11:07.563
If she was going, she could've said something.

144
11:07.647 --> 11:10.608
She can't just slip out without a word. What a little sneak.

145
11:10.692 --> 11:12.360
Seriously, she's such a weirdo.

146
11:12.944 --> 11:13.945
[Sejin sighs]

147
11:16.531 --> 11:18.491
Hey, Kim Sejin.

148
11:20.410 --> 11:22.120
I told you to quit it, didn't I?

149
11:23.663 --> 11:24.664
Didn't I?

150
11:27.458 --> 11:30.545
Why are you always at each other's throats?

151
11:30.628 --> 11:33.172
Why do you two have to fight every time you're together?

152
11:34.340 --> 11:37.093
She's always picking fights and getting on my nerves.

153
11:37.176 --> 11:40.138
Even if she starts it and gets on your nerves,

154
11:40.221 --> 11:42.265
just be patient and let it go.

155
11:42.348 --> 11:43.349
[Sejin] Why should I?

156
11:43.433 --> 11:46.853
Why should I always have to be the patient one and give in?

157
11:46.936 --> 11:49.230
Because, dude...

158
11:51.899 --> 11:53.359
You're a leader who's kinder,

159
11:54.861 --> 11:56.195
more understanding,

160
11:57.572 --> 11:59.324
and more generous than she is.

161
12:01.617 --> 12:02.618
You...

162
12:04.412 --> 12:07.498
When you first joined our lab, you have no idea how happy I was.

163
12:10.460 --> 12:14.547
I thought, "We have a really hardworking, smart, and talented new member.

164
12:15.423 --> 12:19.427
Now I finally have a labmate I can really trust and count on.

165
12:20.386 --> 12:24.307
The lab will be just fine without me."

166
12:25.391 --> 12:27.185
You're just flattering me.

167
12:28.227 --> 12:29.812
We've got other senior members.

168
12:29.896 --> 12:32.690
Come on. Those... Those guys... [inhales]

169
12:32.774 --> 12:35.693
No matter how many times I tell them, they never listen.

170
12:35.777 --> 12:37.779
All they think about is screwing around.

171
12:39.489 --> 12:42.909
Just thinking about those guys gives me an ulcer. You know that.

172
12:44.285 --> 12:48.373
You see, Sejin, you're honestly the only one I can trust and count on.

173
12:49.707 --> 12:51.084
[Sejin sighs]

174
12:51.959 --> 12:55.505
And leaders are supposed to...

175
12:56.756 --> 12:58.299
I know you're smart.

176
12:58.383 --> 13:00.718
But when it comes to leadership, heart beats brains.

177
13:01.844 --> 13:04.931
Kindness and generosity, you know?

178
13:07.433 --> 13:08.434
Okay.

179
13:09.143 --> 13:10.186
All right.

180
13:10.269 --> 13:12.688
I'm counting on you. Okay?

181
13:14.107 --> 13:15.942
[coughs]

182
13:16.025 --> 13:18.069
-[sniffles] Oh man. -Are you okay?

183
13:18.152 --> 13:20.238
I keep feeling like I need to snee...

184
13:20.988 --> 13:22.782
[Minjae sneezes loudly, coughs]

185
13:24.867 --> 13:25.868
Jeez.

186
13:28.663 --> 13:29.664
Hey.

187
13:34.252 --> 13:35.962
That wasn't because of me, was it?

188
13:39.424 --> 13:40.925
[suppressed yell]

189
13:41.008 --> 13:42.009
I mean...

190
13:42.844 --> 13:45.596
-[Sejin whimpers] -[Minjae] Hey, this...

191
13:45.680 --> 13:46.806
[Sejin groans]

192
13:46.889 --> 13:48.891
[♪ gentle music playing]

193
13:51.769 --> 13:53.187
[Minjae groans]

194
13:57.275 --> 13:58.359
[grunts]

195
13:58.442 --> 14:00.987
[coughing]

196
14:03.823 --> 14:04.824
[groans]

197
14:06.742 --> 14:08.077
[cellphone vibrates]

198
14:10.204 --> 14:11.205
[grunts]

199
14:14.500 --> 14:15.543
[Youjin] What are you up to?

200
14:18.296 --> 14:19.297
[groans]

201
14:22.842 --> 14:23.843
[clicks tongue]

202
14:30.391 --> 14:31.475
[cellphone vibrates]

203
14:36.105 --> 14:37.106
[Minjae] Sleeping.

204
14:41.277 --> 14:43.654
[Youjin] Okay. You worked hard today.

205
14:44.280 --> 14:45.781
Sleep well. See you in my dreams.

206
14:49.619 --> 14:50.620
[Minjae] Yup.

207
14:52.413 --> 14:53.706
Come on.

208
14:53.789 --> 14:55.166
Write more than that.

209
15:07.762 --> 15:09.764
[♪ music fades]

210
15:09.847 --> 15:10.848
[groans]

211
15:12.433 --> 15:13.809
[grunts]

212
15:21.651 --> 15:23.653
[♪ quirky music playing]

213
15:33.955 --> 15:36.457
[Youjin] I totally slept in because it's Sunday.

214
15:36.540 --> 15:38.459
Are you up? What are you doing?

215
15:53.266 --> 15:54.308
What are you doing?

216
16:03.818 --> 16:05.903
Look at the time. Why hasn't she come out yet?

217
16:07.488 --> 16:08.739
Hey, Youjin!

218
16:10.032 --> 16:11.450
Go wake her up.

219
16:11.534 --> 16:13.536
[Youseong] She'll come out and eat when she's hungry.

220
16:13.619 --> 16:14.620
[Miyoung] Leave her be.

221
16:14.704 --> 16:16.414
It's Sunday, so she can sleep in.

222
16:16.497 --> 16:18.499
But she has to eat something.

223
16:19.834 --> 16:21.836
She was reading till late last night.

224
16:24.422 --> 16:26.632
Sometimes it's hard to believe she's my daughter.

225
16:27.300 --> 16:29.760
[chuckling] How could she like studying so much?

226
16:31.595 --> 16:33.597
[line ringing]

227
16:41.272 --> 16:42.273
[Minjae] Hello?

228
16:42.857 --> 16:44.025
Oh?

229
16:44.108 --> 16:46.110
What took you so long to pick up?

230
16:46.902 --> 16:48.487
Didn't you get my message?

231
16:50.448 --> 16:56.037
[pharmacist] So take one of these and two of these after every meal.

232
16:56.120 --> 16:57.204
[Youjin] Okay.

233
16:59.457 --> 17:02.001
Do you know of any clinics that are open around here?

234
17:02.084 --> 17:03.627
I couldn't find any online.

235
17:03.711 --> 17:04.795
Uh...

236
17:04.879 --> 17:06.297
I'm not sure.

237
17:06.380 --> 17:09.800
But if these don't work, I'd recommend they go to the ER.

238
17:11.302 --> 17:12.845
I see. Thank you.

239
17:14.305 --> 17:17.350
[doorbell rings]

240
17:22.772 --> 17:23.773
Mmm...

241
17:24.648 --> 17:29.487
-[coughing] -[doorbell rings]

242
17:36.744 --> 17:38.287
[door lock chimes]

243
17:38.371 --> 17:39.372
Oh?

244
17:40.581 --> 17:41.999
[Sejin] What is it this time?

245
17:42.583 --> 17:44.210
You come here pretty often, huh?

246
17:46.003 --> 17:47.797
[Youjin] I don't come here often.

247
17:48.381 --> 17:51.467
Well, I heard he's sick, so I wanted to get him some meds and stuff.

248
17:51.550 --> 17:53.386
[Sejin] Ah... Meds.

249
17:54.970 --> 17:57.056
I already got him some.

250
18:02.353 --> 18:03.354
[door lock chimes]

251
18:04.063 --> 18:05.940
Hey, he's asleep. Don't wake him up.

252
18:07.108 --> 18:09.193
I said he's asleep. You shouldn't wake him up.

253
18:09.276 --> 18:10.778
Hey, move.

254
18:10.861 --> 18:12.113
Get out of my way.

255
18:12.905 --> 18:15.574
[weakly] Hey, what's going on? What's up?

256
18:16.075 --> 18:17.159
I said, move!

257
18:18.911 --> 18:20.788
Minjae, are you okay?

258
18:20.871 --> 18:22.164
[mumbles] I'm okay, I'm okay.

259
18:22.248 --> 18:23.249
[Youjin] My goodness.

260
18:23.916 --> 18:25.876
Hey, you're disturbing his sleep--

261
18:25.960 --> 18:27.044
Hey, stop, be quiet.

262
18:28.170 --> 18:29.797
[Youjin] Uh... Hold on.

263
18:32.133 --> 18:33.134
[clicks]

264
18:34.385 --> 18:35.386
[digital beeps]

265
18:35.469 --> 18:36.470
[softly in English] Thank you.

266
18:37.138 --> 18:39.056
[in Korean] I said I was fine. Why did you come?

267
18:39.140 --> 18:40.933
Because I was worried.

268
18:41.517 --> 18:42.893
[light thud]

269
18:50.067 --> 18:51.152
[Sejin] Here.

270
18:51.777 --> 18:54.655
The porridge is ready, so have some and then take your meds.

271
18:55.906 --> 18:57.950
You didn't have to come. It's just a cold.

272
18:58.492 --> 18:59.660
Did you go to the doctor?

273
19:00.244 --> 19:02.163
It's just a cold. No need to see a doctor.

274
19:02.246 --> 19:04.707
I'll just take these meds from the drugstore. I'm fine.

275
19:06.167 --> 19:09.295
I made it with equal parts milk and water.

276
19:09.378 --> 19:10.796
It's our family secret.

277
19:10.880 --> 19:11.881
[Minjae] Okay.

278
19:13.090 --> 19:14.175
Thanks for making it.

279
19:14.842 --> 19:16.177
[Youjin] Here. Try some.

280
19:17.344 --> 19:18.345
Wait.

281
19:19.513 --> 19:20.514
[Minjae] Why?

282
19:20.598 --> 19:22.016
What do you think you're doing?

283
19:22.683 --> 19:23.684
[Youjin] What?

284
19:27.313 --> 19:28.689
This is my porridge.

285
19:29.482 --> 19:30.900
Why are you doing this?

286
19:32.109 --> 19:33.486
[Youjin] What do you mean, my porridge?

287
19:33.569 --> 19:36.113
Why are you taking credit for the porridge I made?

288
19:37.782 --> 19:40.826
-Go make your own porridge. -[Minjae coughs]

289
19:42.161 --> 19:43.579
[Youjin] Jeez. Just you wait.

290
19:43.662 --> 19:44.663
Have some.

291
19:45.289 --> 19:47.416
Hey, guys, you guys are giving me a headache.

292
19:47.500 --> 19:48.501
Seriously, stop.

293
19:48.584 --> 19:50.836
Eat this porridge and take the meds.

294
19:50.920 --> 19:54.548
Hey, you better not eat a single spoonful of Kim Sejin's porridge, or else.

295
19:54.632 --> 19:56.759
[sighs] Or what would you do, exactly?

296
19:56.842 --> 19:58.677
-[Minjae softly] I'm cold. -[Youjin sighs heavily]

297
19:58.761 --> 20:00.095
Look, Kim Sejin.

298
20:00.179 --> 20:02.765
Try all you want, but you're never going to beat me.

299
20:02.848 --> 20:03.849
[Sejin chuckles softly] What are you saying?

300
20:04.517 --> 20:05.851
I'm not like you.

301
20:06.477 --> 20:07.812
Minjae and I are--

302
20:07.895 --> 20:08.896
[Minjae] Youjin.

303
20:11.232 --> 20:12.608
You see,

304
20:12.691 --> 20:14.610
-Minjae and I are... -[Minjae coughing] Youjin.

305
20:16.821 --> 20:19.615
-We started-- -[doorbell rings]

306
20:19.698 --> 20:20.991
[Minjae sighing] God, who is it now?

307
20:22.284 --> 20:25.830
[doorbell rings]

308
20:25.913 --> 20:27.039
[Minjae] Who is it?

309
20:28.082 --> 20:29.083
Huh?

310
20:30.626 --> 20:32.294
[whispering] Should we just not open the door?

311
20:32.920 --> 20:33.921
[Youjin] Yeah.

312
20:37.216 --> 20:38.217
[door lock chimes]

313
20:39.635 --> 20:40.636
[Seohyun] Oh?

314
20:41.345 --> 20:42.513
You guys were here too?

315
20:42.596 --> 20:43.597
-Hello. -[Youjin] Hello.

316
20:43.681 --> 20:44.682
[Seohyun] Where's Minjae?

317
20:45.266 --> 20:46.308
Are you okay?

318
20:46.392 --> 20:48.185
[Minjae] What are you doing here?

319
20:48.811 --> 20:50.855
-Of course I'm here. You're sick. -[door lock chimes]

320
20:50.938 --> 20:51.939
[Minjae] I'm fine.

321
20:52.481 --> 20:54.567
[Seohyun] I got you some abalone porridge. Have some.

322
20:54.650 --> 20:56.318
-[Minjae coughs] These guys... -[Seohyun] Here.

323
20:56.819 --> 20:58.571
I just bought it, so it's still warm.

324
20:58.654 --> 21:00.948
Look, it's not that serious. I'm fine.

325
21:01.031 --> 21:04.326
[Seohyun] I mean, who catches a cold in the middle of summer?

326
21:04.410 --> 21:06.579
How'd you come down with a cold all of a sudden?

327
21:08.080 --> 21:11.292
It's sweet of you kids to come check on your lab lead when he's sick.

328
21:11.834 --> 21:14.211
I can take care of him, so you can go now.

329
21:14.295 --> 21:16.547
Uh... I don't mind staying a little longer.

330
21:17.214 --> 21:18.591
[Seohyun] It's okay. Go home.

331
21:18.674 --> 21:20.718
You have to work tomorrow. Go get some rest.

332
21:21.218 --> 21:23.137
You should go too. You have work tomorrow.

333
21:23.220 --> 21:24.722
[Seohyun] I'm sleeping over.

334
21:24.805 --> 21:26.640
-What? -[Seohyun] I can go to work from here.

335
21:27.266 --> 21:29.393
It's sad being alone when you're sick.

336
21:30.811 --> 21:33.063
Me too. I can stay the night here too. [chuckles softly]

337
21:33.147 --> 21:35.399
Yeah, I was going to stay with him too.

338
21:35.482 --> 21:37.192
I live closest to here.

339
21:37.985 --> 21:38.986
[Seohyun] Huh?

340
21:39.570 --> 21:41.238
But he's got me. Why would you guys?

341
21:42.740 --> 21:44.700
Because he's got me too.

342
21:45.993 --> 21:47.077
[Sejin] Still...

343
21:47.828 --> 21:51.081
I'm a guy, so... [chuckles]

344
21:51.165 --> 21:52.750
Hey, who cares if you're a guy?

345
21:53.250 --> 21:54.960
[Minjae coughs]

346
21:55.044 --> 21:57.254
Minjae is most comfortable around me.

347
21:57.755 --> 21:58.756
Wait.

348
21:59.924 --> 22:01.842
He feels comfortable around me too. Right?

349
22:02.843 --> 22:04.511
[Sejin] We're both guys.

350
22:04.595 --> 22:07.890
You don't feel comfortable around two women, do you?

351
22:07.973 --> 22:09.975
[♪ comical music playing]

352
22:16.857 --> 22:17.858
[♪ music stops]

353
22:17.942 --> 22:20.527
God, Park Minjae, always so darn stubborn.

354
22:21.236 --> 22:23.364
We come to check on him, and he acts like this?

355
22:23.989 --> 22:25.824
Looks like he's really not feeling well.

356
22:28.494 --> 22:29.828
I'll get going then.

357
22:29.912 --> 22:31.664
Okay. Bye.

358
22:33.958 --> 22:35.668
What are you looking at? Jeez.

359
22:37.544 --> 22:39.129
I'll get going too.

360
22:39.964 --> 22:41.465
Are you taking the subway?

361
22:42.216 --> 22:43.801
I can drop you off at the station.

362
22:44.301 --> 22:45.302
[Youjin] Well...

363
22:45.386 --> 22:47.721
-[footsteps receding] -[♪ gentle music playing]

364
23:49.366 --> 23:51.368
[♪ music fades]

365
23:51.452 --> 23:53.162
Don't you think it's a bit strange?

366
23:53.871 --> 23:55.622
Why would he just kick us out?

367
23:57.958 --> 24:00.002
He's definitely keeping something from us.

368
24:02.212 --> 24:04.131
I think he's seeing a girl.

369
24:05.132 --> 24:06.467
[Youjin] Huh?

370
24:06.550 --> 24:07.551
[Seohyun] But who could it be?

371
24:08.093 --> 24:10.095
I don't think he had a blind date, though.

372
24:10.179 --> 24:11.472
Who could it be?

373
24:12.556 --> 24:14.558
Could it be...

374
24:15.684 --> 24:16.977
that woman with the Mercedes?

375
24:17.978 --> 24:19.229
[Seohyun] Hmm?

376
24:19.313 --> 24:21.774
The woman Kim Sejin saw outside his place.

377
24:21.857 --> 24:24.068
She drove a white Mercedes and was really pretty.

378
24:24.151 --> 24:26.945
[chuckling softly] Oh, that.

379
24:28.489 --> 24:29.948
No.

380
24:30.032 --> 24:31.909
No, she can't be...

381
24:32.743 --> 24:34.078
They're nothing like that.

382
24:35.287 --> 24:36.538
Didn't Minjae tell you?

383
24:38.749 --> 24:39.750
No.

384
24:40.709 --> 24:41.960
Really?

385
24:42.044 --> 24:46.173
Well, if he didn't want to tell you, there must've been a good reason.

386
24:52.304 --> 24:55.390
Looks like you know everything about Minjae.

387
24:55.474 --> 24:57.142
You two must be really close.

388
24:57.226 --> 24:58.227
[Seohyun] Yeah.

389
24:59.103 --> 25:01.438
We go all the way back to high school, so...

390
25:03.690 --> 25:06.360
I heard you're Minjae's first love.

391
25:06.443 --> 25:08.612
[Seohyun chuckles]

392
25:10.155 --> 25:11.865
[Youjin] Then how come you two never dated?

393
25:12.574 --> 25:14.576
That's not true. We used to date.

394
25:15.577 --> 25:16.745
You two used to date?

395
25:16.829 --> 25:18.914
[Seohyun] Yeah, for a little over a month.

396
25:21.166 --> 25:22.417
What, a month?

397
25:22.501 --> 25:24.670
That doesn't count as dating.

398
25:25.587 --> 25:27.840
No, you weren't really together.

399
25:27.923 --> 25:29.299
If that's considered dating,

400
25:29.383 --> 25:31.593
then there's no one on earth who hasn't dated.

401
25:31.677 --> 25:33.846
Everyone's dated. Everyone.

402
25:33.929 --> 25:34.930
Am I wrong?

403
25:35.013 --> 25:36.431
It just doesn't make any sense.

404
25:37.683 --> 25:39.643
What do you mean, it doesn't make any sense?

405
25:39.726 --> 25:43.981
If a man and a woman held hands and kissed,

406
25:44.064 --> 25:45.816
that means they were dating.

407
25:54.783 --> 25:56.785
[indistinct chatter]

408
25:58.036 --> 25:59.913
[sniffles, coughs]

409
26:07.212 --> 26:08.213
[groans softly]

410
26:09.548 --> 26:13.427
I also think high school first-love is childish and lame, you know?

411
26:14.011 --> 26:15.345
It's all in the past anyway.

412
26:15.429 --> 26:16.597
It doesn't mean anything.

413
26:17.806 --> 26:19.224
And Kim Sejin.

414
26:19.308 --> 26:20.726
He's such a sycophant. Okay?

415
26:20.809 --> 26:22.477
He's a crazy little suck-up.

416
26:23.061 --> 26:25.230
And why do I even have to compete with him?

417
26:25.314 --> 26:26.565
Park Minjae is mine anyway.

418
26:27.774 --> 26:29.776
[Jihoon] He's everyone's sweetheart, as they say.

419
26:30.611 --> 26:33.822
Exactly. He's so nice to everyone but me.

420
26:33.906 --> 26:36.116
[Jihoon] If you know that, why even compete with them?

421
26:37.159 --> 26:38.160
That's my point.

422
26:38.243 --> 26:40.662
Why on earth should I compete with these people? Why?

423
26:40.746 --> 26:43.290
[Jihoon] Exactly. Why compete?

424
26:43.373 --> 26:44.917
I mean, yeah!

425
26:45.000 --> 26:47.336
Why do I have to compete with them? What for?

426
26:47.419 --> 26:50.422
[Jihoon] Exactly. So why compete with them?

427
26:50.505 --> 26:53.217
Exactly. Why do I have to compete with them?

428
26:56.303 --> 26:57.304
Monkey.

429
27:01.058 --> 27:03.018
Just take my class for one semester.

430
27:03.101 --> 27:05.354
All your problems with life and love will be gone.

431
27:07.773 --> 27:08.774
Okay?

432
27:09.942 --> 27:11.610
-You sound like a snake oil salesman. -[Jihoon chuckles softly]

433
27:11.693 --> 27:13.904
Yeah, I'm trying to win you over like one.

434
27:16.990 --> 27:19.952
If we'd made it official from the start that we were dating,

435
27:20.035 --> 27:22.079
none of this would've happened.

436
27:22.162 --> 27:24.039
So, what is it you want to do, exactly?

437
27:25.332 --> 27:27.334
I'll tell him to make it official, obviously.

438
27:28.293 --> 27:29.670
What if he doesn't want to?

439
27:29.753 --> 27:30.796
Then?

440
27:31.922 --> 27:32.923
Then...

441
27:33.799 --> 27:35.092
we'll break up, I guess.

442
27:35.175 --> 27:37.177
Good. You got your answer. Now go.

443
27:37.260 --> 27:38.387
You're distracting me.

444
27:41.932 --> 27:42.933
[Minjae] Oh...

445
27:43.809 --> 27:45.227
[groans]

446
27:45.310 --> 27:46.395
Goodness.

447
27:47.020 --> 27:48.146
-Minjae. -[Minjae] Yes?

448
27:48.230 --> 27:50.023
Want me to massage your shoulders?

449
27:50.107 --> 27:52.192
[Minjae] No, that's okay. I'm fine.

450
27:52.275 --> 27:53.276
Just a little.

451
27:53.360 --> 27:55.153
[Minjae] No, I'm fine. I can use this. [groans]

452
27:55.237 --> 27:59.199
I used to give all the older members of my family massages.

453
27:59.282 --> 28:01.827
-Oh boy. -That's how I earned my allowance.

454
28:01.910 --> 28:02.911
[Minjae] Oh...

455
28:02.995 --> 28:03.996
-[Sejin grunts] -[Minjae groans]

456
28:04.079 --> 28:05.080
[door opens]

457
28:05.163 --> 28:06.331
That's nice.

458
28:06.415 --> 28:07.749
-[door closes] -[Minjae sighs in relief]

459
28:08.959 --> 28:11.128
[Minjae moaning]

460
28:14.214 --> 28:16.174
-[Sejin] Here? -[Minjae groans]

461
28:18.969 --> 28:19.970
Hi, Youjin.

462
28:20.053 --> 28:21.847
-Hey. -[Minjae sighs in relief]

463
28:23.682 --> 28:25.350
-You're really good. -[Sejin grunts]

464
28:25.434 --> 28:27.144
[Minjae] Gosh, that really hits the spot.

465
28:28.145 --> 28:30.230
[Minjae groans in relief]

466
28:33.567 --> 28:35.902
Well, Sejin was just giving me a massage

467
28:35.986 --> 28:37.863
because I said my shoulders were hurting.

468
28:37.946 --> 28:40.073
I don't see what's wrong with that.

469
28:41.324 --> 28:43.285
I'm going to tell Kim Sejin everything.

470
28:43.368 --> 28:44.369
That we're dating.

471
28:45.328 --> 28:46.830
We already talked about this.

472
28:48.373 --> 28:50.042
I heard about Seohyun too.

473
28:51.668 --> 28:53.045
You two used to date?

474
28:56.089 --> 28:59.551
From now on, don't meet up with her alone or have her over at your place.

475
28:59.634 --> 29:01.386
Don't go over to hers, either.

476
29:04.598 --> 29:07.184
I can't promise that.

477
29:09.186 --> 29:10.604
I mean, when she said we dated,

478
29:11.480 --> 29:14.441
all that happened was we joked about dating

479
29:14.524 --> 29:16.401
if we ended up at the same college.

480
29:17.402 --> 29:19.488
And even then, it didn't last a month.

481
29:19.571 --> 29:21.448
It was really nothing.

482
29:22.574 --> 29:23.909
I heard you kissed too.

483
29:25.452 --> 29:27.370
That was barely a kiss.

484
29:27.454 --> 29:29.790
She's talking about the time during a drinking game.

485
29:30.624 --> 29:33.585
I didn't feel a thing, and I don't even remember it.

486
29:35.837 --> 29:37.130
This is really unfair.

487
29:37.214 --> 29:38.507
You're my first, I swear.

488
29:42.677 --> 29:44.930
You were pretty good for your first time, though.

489
29:45.013 --> 29:46.014
What...

490
29:47.015 --> 29:48.266
You were better than...

491
29:50.018 --> 29:51.228
What about you? I bet...

492
29:51.937 --> 29:55.899
you kissed plenty of other guys too, right?

493
29:56.817 --> 29:58.193
[Youjin scoffs]

494
29:58.276 --> 30:00.612
Yes, tons of times.

495
30:01.488 --> 30:03.281
I've dated tons of guys.

496
30:03.365 --> 30:05.450
Kissing, making out, and everything else.

497
30:05.534 --> 30:06.952
I've done it all tons of times.

498
30:09.121 --> 30:10.747
Everything else?

499
30:13.583 --> 30:16.086
But that's all in the past.

500
30:16.795 --> 30:19.548
I'm not in touch with any of them anymore. I've cut all ties.

501
30:21.716 --> 30:24.636
I'm not saying you should never see her again.

502
30:24.719 --> 30:28.140
You just can't meet up with her alone or have her over at your place.

503
30:29.808 --> 30:31.184
You can't even do that for me?

504
30:33.812 --> 30:35.230
No, I can't.

505
30:35.939 --> 30:36.940
[Youjin] Why not?

506
30:38.316 --> 30:40.735
Like I said, she's my best friend.

507
30:40.819 --> 30:43.488
Your girlfriend should be your best friend. Me.

508
30:46.533 --> 30:48.743
Hey, the professor wants to see me. I have to go.

509
30:49.327 --> 30:51.663
So you're okay with not seeing me anymore?

510
30:55.584 --> 30:57.210
Are you okay with not seeing me?

511
30:59.588 --> 31:01.423
Do you realize what you're saying?

512
31:03.300 --> 31:05.343
Of course I do. You think I don't?

513
31:13.435 --> 31:14.769
Okay. Fine.

514
31:16.813 --> 31:18.023
[Youjin] What do you mean, fine?

515
31:18.106 --> 31:20.066
That you can't see me anymore.

516
31:21.443 --> 31:22.444
I get it.

517
31:25.655 --> 31:26.656
[grunts]

518
31:30.577 --> 31:32.454
What if I can't see her anymore?

519
31:33.246 --> 31:36.374
I'm going to nip those nasty little games in the bud. Jeez.

520
31:44.925 --> 31:47.260
[Hangyeol] Move it forward first.

521
31:52.390 --> 31:53.516
Now backward.

522
31:55.352 --> 31:56.353
To the right.

523
31:59.189 --> 32:00.190
To the left.

524
32:01.691 --> 32:02.692
Now, to the right.

525
32:08.740 --> 32:11.368
-Are we done? -Yeah, we're done.

526
32:11.451 --> 32:13.995
How do the peak torque and left-right balance look?

527
32:14.079 --> 32:15.121
They're all good.

528
32:15.205 --> 32:16.206
-Yeah? -Yes.

529
32:16.289 --> 32:18.375
Don't we need to work on posture control too?

530
32:19.751 --> 32:20.752
[Minjae] Yeah.

531
32:20.835 --> 32:23.463
Guys, we need the results by the end of next month.

532
32:23.546 --> 32:24.923
Okay?

533
32:25.006 --> 32:26.174
That's going to be tight.

534
32:32.639 --> 32:33.848
Good work, guys.

535
32:34.391 --> 32:35.517
Let's call it a day.

536
32:35.600 --> 32:37.018
[flushing]

537
32:41.898 --> 32:43.900
[cellphone vibrates]

538
32:47.237 --> 32:49.823
[Minjae] Go ahead and wait for me at my place. I'll be there soon.

539
32:57.580 --> 32:58.999
[Youjin] So you promise?

540
33:01.376 --> 33:02.627
[Minjae] What promise?

541
33:02.711 --> 33:03.920
Don't start with me.

542
33:11.136 --> 33:13.138
[Youjin] What if Kim Sejin is there?

543
33:14.556 --> 33:16.474
[Minjae] He went to Daejeon for a family gathering.

544
33:19.519 --> 33:21.354
[Youjin] I don't know the passcode to your place.

545
33:25.066 --> 33:26.234
[Minjae] The day we first met.

546
33:27.694 --> 33:29.696
-[♪ gentle music playing] -[giggles]

547
33:42.667 --> 33:43.960
[door lock chimes]

548
33:44.711 --> 33:45.712
[door opens]

549
33:53.720 --> 33:54.721
[door lock chimes]

550
35:05.542 --> 35:08.545
SLAM DUNK

551
35:09.212 --> 35:11.214
[♪ gentle music continues playing]

552
36:33.713 --> 36:35.715
[♪ music fades]

553
36:36.800 --> 36:39.093
[Jaehong] Yeah. Spring brides are always the prettiest.

554
36:39.177 --> 36:41.221
-You picked a good date. -[Seohyun chuckles]

555
36:41.304 --> 36:42.305
Congratulations.

556
36:42.388 --> 36:45.391
Yeah, thank you. [chuckles]

557
36:45.475 --> 36:47.143
It's at the wedding hall on campus.

558
36:47.227 --> 36:48.269
You'll come, right?

559
36:48.353 --> 36:51.064
Distance doesn't matter. Of course I'll come.

560
36:51.147 --> 36:54.526
She's my favorite, you know, student.

561
36:54.609 --> 36:56.903
[chuckles softly] You promise?

562
36:56.986 --> 36:59.113
[Jaehong] Of course. See?

563
36:59.197 --> 37:01.908
Everyone else is finding someone and settling down.

564
37:01.991 --> 37:03.618
Park Minjae, what's wrong with you?

565
37:03.701 --> 37:06.412
Me? Why are you suddenly making this about me? [chuckles]

566
37:06.496 --> 37:09.624
Wouldn't it be great to meet someone and take her to the States?

567
37:10.500 --> 37:12.418
Do you know anyone you could set him up with?

568
37:12.502 --> 37:15.338
[sighs] He's really picky, so...

569
37:15.421 --> 37:16.798
I know.

570
37:17.882 --> 37:21.094
I wonder which lucky lady will end up with our Minjae.

571
37:21.970 --> 37:24.389
If not in Korea, maybe she's in the States?

572
37:24.472 --> 37:25.807
His soulmate, I mean.

573
37:25.890 --> 37:27.392
Maybe she's American?

574
37:27.475 --> 37:29.060
[Seohyun] Yeah, maybe.

575
37:29.143 --> 37:31.896
Or maybe she's nearby.

576
37:32.689 --> 37:35.024
[Seohyun laughs]

577
37:35.108 --> 37:36.317
[door closes]

578
37:40.613 --> 37:42.657
-[Seohyun] Looks like they cleaned up. -[Minjae grunts]

579
37:44.993 --> 37:45.994
[sighs]

580
37:50.999 --> 37:53.877
I heard the school wedding hall is really hard to book.

581
37:53.960 --> 37:55.295
-How did you manage to get it? -[Seohyun scoffs]

582
37:55.378 --> 37:57.088
I've got my ways.

583
37:57.755 --> 38:00.091
I'll share them with you when you get married.

584
38:04.262 --> 38:06.222
[Minjae] No more late-night calls, I guess.

585
38:07.765 --> 38:11.311
No more calling each other up to catch a movie on the weekend,

586
38:13.438 --> 38:18.401
or randomly taking off for the beach on a freezing winter day.

587
38:21.112 --> 38:23.197
So, what, you're happy about it?

588
38:23.281 --> 38:24.949
You're saying it's a good thing?

589
38:25.033 --> 38:26.743
[Minjae] No, I'm saying...

590
38:26.826 --> 38:31.205
We're moving on to the next chapter of our lives.

591
38:33.124 --> 38:34.125
[Seohyun] Minjae.

592
38:34.208 --> 38:35.209
[Minjae] Yes?

593
38:35.293 --> 38:37.754
Instead of a wedding gift, I'd like to ask you a favor.

594
38:38.254 --> 38:39.297
[Minjae] What is it?

595
38:39.380 --> 38:41.049
Do you need anything?

596
38:41.758 --> 38:43.468
Could you sing at my wedding?

597
38:45.178 --> 38:47.305
-What? Sing at your wedding? -[Seohyun] Yes, sing.

598
38:48.556 --> 38:52.727
[chuckles] Come on, you're a great singer. You're the only one I can ask.

599
38:53.686 --> 38:54.729
Hey, wake up.

600
38:54.812 --> 38:57.440
This isn't karaoke after some work dinner.

601
38:57.523 --> 38:59.984
This is your wedding, a once-in-a-lifetime event.

602
39:00.068 --> 39:01.736
Well, who knows?

603
39:01.819 --> 39:05.949
It could be once, it could be twice... [snickers]

604
39:06.616 --> 39:08.785
Come on. Do it for me.

605
39:08.868 --> 39:09.869
[scoffs]

606
39:10.828 --> 39:13.122
Mr. Nam seriously needs his eyes checked.

607
39:13.748 --> 39:15.333
What does he even see in you?

608
39:15.416 --> 39:17.210
I feel so bad for the guy. I really do.

609
39:18.044 --> 39:20.296
[Seohyun] So you're not doing it?

610
39:21.172 --> 39:23.633
Of course not. I can't.

611
39:23.716 --> 39:25.385
Me? Sing at a wedding?

612
39:26.260 --> 39:27.762
Really? [sighs]

613
39:28.972 --> 39:30.723
Then I'll tell the guys.

614
39:30.807 --> 39:31.808
[Minjae] Tell them what?

615
39:32.433 --> 39:34.143
She seriously needs her eyes checked.

616
39:34.227 --> 39:36.437
What does she even see in a loser like you?

617
39:37.647 --> 39:39.440
She's just young and naive

618
39:39.524 --> 39:42.443
and doesn't know how the world works, am I right? [snickers]

619
39:43.152 --> 39:47.865
She has no clue how petty and obnoxious our dear Park Minjae is.

620
39:47.949 --> 39:50.535
Imagine what that pretty girl will have to go through.

621
39:50.618 --> 39:52.495
I already feel sorry for her.

622
39:52.578 --> 39:54.038
I really do.

623
39:54.122 --> 39:56.124
[♪ lively music playing]

624
39:57.375 --> 39:59.585
So are you going to sing or not?

625
40:03.548 --> 40:05.550
[♪ lively music continues playing]

626
40:42.045 --> 40:45.840
[doorbell rings]

627
41:11.783 --> 41:13.785
[♪ music fades]

628
41:42.814 --> 41:44.524
Wait, excuse me.

629
41:49.278 --> 41:50.279
Yes?

630
41:50.363 --> 41:51.739
Who are you?

631
41:52.907 --> 41:54.200
What do you mean, who am I?

632
41:54.951 --> 41:57.286
And who are you?

633
41:59.747 --> 42:02.333
I'm Park Minjae's girlfriend.

634
42:07.880 --> 42:09.882
[♪ piano music playing]

635
42:16.139 --> 42:17.181
Okay. Thank you.

636
42:17.265 --> 42:18.266
Thank you.

637
42:21.519 --> 42:22.603
Lim Youjin?

638
42:23.104 --> 42:24.105
[Youjin] Yes.

639
42:26.232 --> 42:27.984
Can I just call you Youjin?

640
42:28.067 --> 42:29.694
Or Ms. Youjin?

641
42:30.236 --> 42:32.196
Please, just call me Youjin.

642
42:32.989 --> 42:34.740
And feel free to be casual with me.

643
42:35.241 --> 42:38.828
[chuckles softly] I will, once we get a little closer.

644
42:41.998 --> 42:45.710
Minjae never told me about his girlfriend, so I was surprised.

645
42:55.553 --> 42:56.637
[softly] Thank you.

646
42:59.098 --> 43:01.392
[Eunjoo] So are you in the same lab as him?

647
43:01.475 --> 43:02.894
At Seohan National University?

648
43:02.977 --> 43:03.978
Yes.

649
43:05.438 --> 43:08.274
It's so cool to see a woman studying robotics.

650
43:08.357 --> 43:11.569
[chuckles softly] I'm just learning.

651
43:11.652 --> 43:13.196
I don't really know much yet.

652
43:13.946 --> 43:15.615
It's really cool.

653
43:15.698 --> 43:17.658
And you and Minjae look great together.

654
43:21.037 --> 43:24.332
Your parents must be so happy to have a cool daughter like you.

655
43:25.249 --> 43:26.375
[chuckling] Not at all.

656
43:26.876 --> 43:28.294
What do your parents do?

657
43:29.754 --> 43:31.505
[Youjin] They run a small auto repair shop.

658
43:32.381 --> 43:33.382
Pardon?

659
43:34.342 --> 43:35.551
An auto repair shop.

660
43:36.135 --> 43:38.262
Oh... For cars.

661
43:38.346 --> 43:40.514
Cars are machines too. [inhales]

662
43:40.598 --> 43:42.725
Looks like you inherited your parents' talents.

663
43:45.228 --> 43:46.479
What about your mother?

664
43:46.562 --> 43:47.772
Is she a housewife?

665
43:47.855 --> 43:50.107
She works at the auto repair shop too.

666
43:51.359 --> 43:52.818
She's a mechanic too?

667
43:54.278 --> 43:55.821
She does the bookkeeping.

668
43:56.781 --> 43:59.408
She handles the receipts and finances for the shop.

669
43:59.492 --> 44:03.204
Right. I thought she was a mechanic too. You surprised me there.

670
44:03.829 --> 44:05.039
[chuckles]

671
44:07.667 --> 44:08.960
Do you have any siblings?

672
44:10.336 --> 44:12.296
I have a brother who's a year older than me.

673
44:12.838 --> 44:14.382
[Eunjoo] A year older, that means...

674
44:14.924 --> 44:16.259
He's 26.

675
44:17.551 --> 44:18.886
He must be a student then.

676
44:20.346 --> 44:23.140
No, he works at the auto repair shop too.

677
44:26.644 --> 44:28.437
Your family sounds so close-knit.

678
44:29.730 --> 44:31.232
It's really lovely.

679
44:36.487 --> 44:38.447
[door lock chimes]

680
44:44.870 --> 44:45.871
[door lock chimes]

681
44:46.455 --> 44:47.456
Youjin.

682
45:03.848 --> 45:05.683
It was nice meeting you today.

683
45:05.766 --> 45:07.018
I had a great time.

684
45:07.560 --> 45:08.561
[Youjin] Sure.

685
45:10.396 --> 45:12.815
Uh... And I'd appreciate it

686
45:12.898 --> 45:15.359
if you didn't tell Minjae that we met today.

687
45:17.695 --> 45:21.407
He's going to give me an earful for meeting you without him.

688
45:22.116 --> 45:23.826
He's so bossy with me.

689
45:26.329 --> 45:28.706
Please don't tell Minjae.

690
45:28.789 --> 45:29.957
Can you do that for me?

691
45:30.624 --> 45:32.043
[chuckles softly] Okay.

692
45:33.002 --> 45:34.003
[Eunjoo] Thank you.

693
45:45.639 --> 45:48.934
Oh... Hop in. I'll drive you home.

694
45:49.018 --> 45:51.354
No, it's okay. I can get home pretty quickly by bus.

695
45:51.437 --> 45:52.438
Your car's here.

696
45:53.522 --> 45:54.648
[Eunjoo] Do you live near here?

697
45:55.691 --> 45:56.692
Yes.

698
45:57.318 --> 45:58.611
Where do you live?

699
46:00.196 --> 46:01.238
Bongcheon-dong.

700
46:02.281 --> 46:05.576
Bongcheon-dong? Is the auto repair shop in Bongcheon-dong too?

701
46:06.369 --> 46:07.370
Yes.

702
46:08.162 --> 46:09.997
What's the name of the auto repair shop?

703
46:11.082 --> 46:13.209
I'm just curious.

704
46:20.674 --> 46:21.926
[sighs]

705
46:30.935 --> 46:34.271
[cellphone vibrating]

706
46:43.197 --> 46:45.366
[clears throat] Hey.

707
46:46.409 --> 46:47.410
Where are you?

708
46:49.286 --> 46:51.288
[♪ soft music playing]

709
46:52.873 --> 46:54.208
I'm home too.

710
46:54.291 --> 46:56.794
My mom wanted me home early, so I came back.

711
46:56.877 --> 46:57.878
Ah...

712
46:58.421 --> 47:00.423
Sorry I got home so late.

713
47:00.506 --> 47:02.716
You just did chores all day and left, didn't you?

714
47:03.926 --> 47:04.927
[Youjin] Yeah.

715
47:07.513 --> 47:08.931
You can do them next time.

716
47:09.723 --> 47:10.891
We'll take turns.

717
47:11.392 --> 47:13.727
Okay. I'll make you something good next time.

718
47:15.062 --> 47:16.147
Thanks for this.

719
47:17.982 --> 47:18.983
Bye.

720
47:20.943 --> 47:21.944
[line disconnects]

721
47:51.098 --> 47:54.435
CHEIL AUTO REPAIR SHOP

722
47:54.518 --> 47:56.562
Let's watch baseball, not the soap opera.

723
47:56.645 --> 47:57.688
It's almost over.

724
47:58.272 --> 47:59.315
Just wait.

725
48:02.735 --> 48:05.029
[woman on TV] I've always wanted to ask you this, Hyeri.

726
48:08.616 --> 48:09.617
We got a car.

727
48:10.117 --> 48:11.118
Come on.

728
48:14.371 --> 48:15.372
[woman on TV] Junil...

729
48:20.794 --> 48:22.671
-[Youseong] Hello. Welcome! -[Yongseok] Welcome.

730
48:22.755 --> 48:23.756
Hello.

731
48:28.469 --> 48:30.971
The brakes aren't working right. Could you take a look?

732
48:31.055 --> 48:32.056
[Yongseok] Sure.

733
48:32.139 --> 48:33.474
-[Youseong] Is your car key inside? -Yes.

734
48:33.557 --> 48:34.934
-[Youseong] Please wait inside. -This way.

735
48:35.017 --> 48:36.018
Okay.

736
48:41.690 --> 48:43.108
[Miyoung chuckles]

737
48:43.192 --> 48:44.818
Hello, please have a seat here.

738
48:44.902 --> 48:45.903
Okay.

739
48:47.404 --> 48:49.114
[Miyoung] Would you like something to drink?

740
48:49.198 --> 48:50.991
Yeah, sure. Anything's fine.

741
48:51.075 --> 48:52.076
[Miyoung] Okay.

742
48:57.581 --> 48:59.416
Is this your first time at our shop?

743
48:59.500 --> 49:00.501
Yes.

744
49:01.210 --> 49:03.379
[Miyoung] You don't seem to be from around here.

745
49:05.089 --> 49:08.759
We don't get many Mercedes owners in this neighborhood.

746
49:10.678 --> 49:12.888
We haven't worked on that many Mercedes,

747
49:13.597 --> 49:16.016
but we've done this a long time, so we know our stuff.

748
49:16.100 --> 49:18.018
-Thank you. -[Miyoung] Sure.

749
49:23.357 --> 49:24.358
[slurps]

750
49:27.486 --> 49:30.573
Looks like your brake pads are a bit worn down.

751
49:30.656 --> 49:32.491
Once replaced, you should be good to go.

752
49:33.242 --> 49:34.451
Then please go ahead.

753
49:34.535 --> 49:38.497
Well, the thing is, we don't have the Mercedes parts in stock right now.

754
49:38.581 --> 49:40.874
You should take it to an authorized service center.

755
49:42.376 --> 49:44.128
Ah... Really?

756
49:44.712 --> 49:46.130
Well, I guess I have no choice.

757
49:46.213 --> 49:48.048
Gosh, I'm sorry I can't help.

758
49:48.132 --> 49:49.633
No. Don't worry.

759
49:51.927 --> 49:52.970
We're sorry.

760
49:53.053 --> 49:54.722
-[Eunjoo] That's all right. -Okay.

761
50:01.228 --> 50:02.229
[grunts]

762
50:04.356 --> 50:05.357
[door opens]

763
50:08.986 --> 50:10.154
Mom?

764
50:10.237 --> 50:12.031
[Miyoung] Yes. You were home.

765
50:17.828 --> 50:19.997
-What's that? -[Miyoung] Ah...

766
50:20.497 --> 50:22.875
This woman came into the shop today.

767
50:23.876 --> 50:26.587
She looked so elegant, and her skin was just glowing.

768
50:27.129 --> 50:30.382
You could tell right away she was some wealthy lady. Like really rich.

769
50:30.924 --> 50:32.968
She even pulled up in a white Mercedes. [gasps]

770
50:33.594 --> 50:35.721
Wow. [chuckles]

771
50:35.804 --> 50:39.767
But we didn't have any Mercedes parts, so we told her we couldn't fix it.

772
50:39.850 --> 50:42.728
Then she apologized for putting us through all that trouble

773
50:42.811 --> 50:44.813
and said we should at least accept this.

774
50:44.897 --> 50:46.065
Gosh.

775
50:46.148 --> 50:49.610
How could someone be so polite and considerate?

776
50:49.693 --> 50:51.862
Still, you shouldn't accept something like this.

777
50:51.945 --> 50:53.739
I tried to say no at first.

778
50:53.822 --> 50:57.785
But then she said she'd received it as a gift herself,

779
50:57.868 --> 51:00.704
and there weren't enough people in her family to finish it all,

780
51:00.788 --> 51:02.122
so it would just go bad.

781
51:03.707 --> 51:06.543
She gave it to us because it'd go bad? What are we, beggars?

782
51:06.627 --> 51:08.295
What do you mean, beggars?

783
51:09.254 --> 51:11.006
[Youjin] You still shouldn't have accepted it.

784
51:11.090 --> 51:13.133
What do you think she'll think of us?

785
51:13.217 --> 51:14.927
She gave it to us as an apology.

786
51:15.010 --> 51:17.429
Who gives something like this as an apology?

787
51:18.472 --> 51:21.725
Stop watching those soap operas all day and read a book once in a while.

788
51:21.809 --> 51:24.061
Use your brain for once and get some common sense.

789
51:24.770 --> 51:26.939
No wonder you bring home stuff like some beggar.

790
51:27.022 --> 51:28.607
Don't you have any pride, Mom?

791
51:30.943 --> 51:32.653
God, seriously.

792
51:32.736 --> 51:34.738
[Youjin breathing heavily]

793
51:40.327 --> 51:41.995
-[Miyoung sobs] -[Youjin sighs]

794
51:42.079 --> 51:44.081
[whimpering]

795
51:44.164 --> 51:46.166
[♪ emotional music playing]

796
51:56.427 --> 51:58.429
[sniffing, sobbing]

797
52:20.409 --> 52:21.410
[Miyoung sniffles]

798
52:39.928 --> 52:40.929
Mom.

799
52:41.889 --> 52:43.307
Mom, I'm sorry.

800
52:44.433 --> 52:46.268
Mom, I was wrong. [sobs]

801
52:46.351 --> 52:47.686
Mom, I'm sorry.

802
52:47.770 --> 52:49.605
Mom, I'm sorry. [crying]

803
52:49.688 --> 52:51.064
I was wrong.

804
52:53.442 --> 52:55.319
Mom. [crying]

805
52:58.030 --> 52:59.740
Mom, I'm sorry.

806
53:03.327 --> 53:04.453
Mom, I'm sorry.

807
53:10.042 --> 53:11.460
[Miyoung] No, I'm sorry.

808
53:19.218 --> 53:21.220
[♪ music fades]

809
53:22.304 --> 53:24.515
TWO PEOPLE

810
53:24.598 --> 53:28.185
[Minjae singing] ♪ After a long day ♪

811
53:29.061 --> 53:31.897
♪ Two people beneath the moonlight ♪

812
53:32.564 --> 53:33.774
[in normal voice] Is this right?

813
53:36.068 --> 53:38.278
This... And...

814
53:40.155 --> 53:42.282
PLEDGE OF LOVE

815
53:42.366 --> 53:48.288
[singing] ♪ The moment I've longed for ♪

816
53:49.289 --> 53:50.290
[sighs]

817
53:56.296 --> 53:59.675
-[line connects, rings] -[Youjin sighs]

818
53:59.758 --> 54:01.718
I think anything would be fine.

819
54:02.886 --> 54:04.721
I don't know much about music.

820
54:04.805 --> 54:06.348
[Minjae] Come on.

821
54:06.431 --> 54:10.060
There must be a song you like.

822
54:10.143 --> 54:12.729
Or something you'd want to hear.

823
54:12.813 --> 54:15.274
If you can think of one, I'll sing it for you.

824
54:15.357 --> 54:16.775
[♪ gentle music playing]

825
54:16.859 --> 54:19.027
If you sing at night, ghosts will come out.

826
54:20.445 --> 54:21.864
[Minjae] Wasn't it snakes?

827
54:21.947 --> 54:24.449
The thing that comes out if you sing at night. Snakes.

828
54:26.034 --> 54:27.578
[Youjin] That's what the flute does.

829
54:28.412 --> 54:30.205
If you play the flute, snakes come out.

830
54:30.289 --> 54:31.665
If you sing, ghosts come out.

831
54:32.416 --> 54:34.251
What happened to your voice, by the way?

832
54:35.043 --> 54:36.211
Are you feeling unwell?

833
54:36.753 --> 54:37.754
Are you sick?

834
54:38.297 --> 54:40.382
No, I'm not.

835
54:40.465 --> 54:41.592
I'm fine.

836
54:43.468 --> 54:46.680
[sighs] Just sing something old. Something classic.

837
54:47.848 --> 54:49.558
Okay.

838
54:49.641 --> 54:52.102
I'll do more research.

839
54:52.769 --> 54:53.770
Okay.

840
54:54.605 --> 54:55.606
Bye.

841
54:57.899 --> 54:58.900
[line disconnects]

842
55:04.072 --> 55:06.074
[breathes heavily]

843
55:11.913 --> 55:13.915
[♪ music fades]

844
55:22.257 --> 55:24.259
SEOHAN NATIONAL UNIVERSITY FACULTY CLUB

845
55:24.343 --> 55:26.345
-[indistinct chatter] -[♪ lively instrumental music playing]

846
55:33.101 --> 55:35.812
[photographer] I'm going to take the picture now. Look this way.

847
55:35.896 --> 55:37.564
All right, one, two, three.

848
55:37.648 --> 55:38.649
One, two, three.

849
55:38.732 --> 55:40.567
-One, two, three. -Look over here.

850
55:41.568 --> 55:42.694
Thank you.

851
55:42.778 --> 55:44.363
-Congratulations, Seohyun. -Thanks.

852
55:44.446 --> 55:46.615
[Youjin] Yeah. And? Did you get it?

853
55:48.241 --> 55:50.452
Thanks, Subin. You're the best. Bye.

854
55:53.372 --> 55:54.456
-[Seohyun] Thanks, Auntie. -Okay.

855
55:54.539 --> 55:56.541
-[Seoyhun] Make sure to enjoy the meal. -See you later.

856
55:56.625 --> 55:58.627
-Say bye to your aunt. [chuckles] -Bye, Auntie.

857
55:59.419 --> 56:01.046
Your bouquet is almost here.

858
56:01.129 --> 56:02.798
That's great to hear. Thank you.

859
56:03.924 --> 56:05.842
[coordinator] Seohyun, let's get ready for your entrance.

860
56:05.926 --> 56:06.927
Okay.

861
56:07.010 --> 56:08.011
[crowd clapping]

862
56:08.095 --> 56:11.181
[host] Next, we will have the ceremonial candle lighting to light the way

863
56:11.264 --> 56:13.517
for the bride and groom's bright future.

864
56:20.273 --> 56:21.274
Light the candles.

865
56:24.111 --> 56:28.323
[♪ grand music playing]

866
56:34.871 --> 56:35.872
[Subin] Youjin!

867
56:35.956 --> 56:37.624
-Here. -Subin. Thanks so much.

868
56:39.084 --> 56:40.669
Seohyun, here.

869
56:40.752 --> 56:43.755
-Oh! Thank you. -Wishing you a happy marriage!

870
56:43.839 --> 56:45.257
[Seohyun] Thank you. We got this!

871
56:46.466 --> 56:50.262
[host] It's time for the stars of today's celebration to make their entrance.

872
56:50.345 --> 56:53.557
They met at the same company as a researcher and a team leader,

873
56:53.640 --> 56:58.270
and now they've promised to become a team for life.

874
56:58.353 --> 57:03.567
As they take the first step on their long journey together,

875
57:03.650 --> 57:08.238
please greet them with your loudest cheers and applause.

876
57:08.321 --> 57:10.449
Please welcome the bride and groom!

877
57:10.532 --> 57:12.534
-[♪ lively music playing] -[applause]

878
57:39.311 --> 57:41.313
[♪ music fades]

879
57:41.396 --> 57:44.024
[applauding, cheering]

880
57:44.107 --> 57:50.697
Next, the couple will exchange rings as a symbol of their love.

881
57:50.781 --> 57:56.203
Groom, please place the ring on the bride's finger,

882
57:56.286 --> 58:01.124
and bride, please place the ring on the groom's.

883
58:07.422 --> 58:11.176
Next, the couple will exchange wedding vows,

884
58:11.259 --> 58:13.261
committing themselves to each other for life.

885
58:14.221 --> 58:18.475
We ask everyone here to bear witness

886
58:18.558 --> 58:22.145
as they recite their promises of love.

887
58:23.063 --> 58:24.564
[Yoonsoo] "Wedding Vow."

888
58:25.148 --> 58:26.274
[♪ gentle music playing]

889
58:26.358 --> 58:28.735
"When I think of our future together,

890
58:28.819 --> 58:32.697
the first thing I picture is a life filled with warmth and happiness.

891
58:32.781 --> 58:34.407
But I also know that the road ahead

892
58:34.491 --> 58:37.077
won't always be easy or filled only with good times."

893
58:37.911 --> 58:40.288
[Yoonsoo] "Difficult moments will come,

894
58:40.372 --> 58:43.708
but just as we have until now, we will face them hand in hand,

895
58:43.792 --> 58:46.461
trusting and cherishing one another."

896
58:47.128 --> 58:49.172
"We will always put each other first,

897
58:49.256 --> 58:51.842
express our love and gratitude without holding back,

898
58:51.925 --> 58:53.844
and build a loving life together."

899
58:54.594 --> 58:58.181
[both] "Before everyone gathered here today, we sincerely vow to love each other

900
58:58.265 --> 59:02.018
for all the years to come just as we do in this moment,

901
59:02.102 --> 59:05.897
and to be the best friend either of us could ever ask for."

902
59:05.981 --> 59:08.024
"Groom Nam Yoonsoo."

903
59:08.108 --> 59:09.943
"Bride Cha Seohyun."

904
59:10.026 --> 59:11.903
[host] Please give them a big round of applause.

905
59:11.987 --> 59:13.989
[applauding]

906
59:19.077 --> 59:23.039
Next, we have a special song for the bride and groom.

907
59:23.748 --> 59:29.796
It will be performed by the bride's longtime friend, Park Minjae.

908
59:29.880 --> 59:32.090
[all applauding]

909
59:35.135 --> 59:36.928
[♪ piano music playing, Kim Kwangjin "Pledge of Love"]

910
01:00:03.163 --> 01:00:08.335
[singing] ♪ The moment I've longed for ♪

911
01:00:09.878 --> 01:00:15.467
♪ Is finally here ♪

912
01:00:16.384 --> 01:00:22.724
♪ With everyone's blessings ♪

913
01:00:23.642 --> 01:00:29.189
♪ We're making our vows of love ♪

914
01:00:30.440 --> 01:00:35.779
♪ When the years have passed ♪

915
01:00:37.072 --> 01:00:42.619
♪ And we're weary and ill ♪

916
01:00:43.286 --> 01:00:49.417
♪ Will we still stand by each other ♪

917
01:00:50.335 --> 01:00:55.799
♪ And offer comfort, just as we do now? ♪

918
01:00:55.882 --> 01:01:02.222
♪ With all the years we have ♪

919
01:01:02.305 --> 01:01:08.269
♪ Yet to walk through together ♪

920
01:01:08.353 --> 01:01:15.151
♪ Do you believe the promises ♪

921
01:01:15.235 --> 01:01:21.992
♪ We've made will never change? ♪

922
01:01:22.117 --> 01:01:28.248
♪ There will be difficult days ♪

923
01:01:28.415 --> 01:01:34.462
♪ But I know I will have no regrets ♪

924
01:01:34.546 --> 01:01:38.675
♪ I believe our lives ♪

925
01:01:38.758 --> 01:01:43.763
♪ Will be filled with love ♪

926
01:01:43.847 --> 01:01:50.854
♪ Until the day heaven calls us home ♪

927
01:02:10.331 --> 01:02:11.332
[Minjae in normal voice] Hey.

928
01:02:15.879 --> 01:02:17.047
I love you.

929
01:02:18.757 --> 01:02:20.133
Do you love me too?

930
01:02:21.009 --> 01:02:23.053
Why would you ask me all of a sudden?

931
01:02:24.512 --> 01:02:26.473
You love me at least a little, right?

932
01:02:26.973 --> 01:02:28.933
Probably not as much as my mom does, though.

933
01:02:31.269 --> 01:02:35.940
No one in the world loves me as much as she does.

934
01:02:37.776 --> 01:02:38.902
So...

935
01:02:40.862 --> 01:02:44.282
if anyone messes with or hurts my mom or anyone else in my family,

936
01:02:45.492 --> 01:02:46.826
I will never let that slide.

937
01:02:50.538 --> 01:02:51.998
But that's a different story.

938
01:02:52.082 --> 01:02:53.583
You didn't do anything wrong.

939
01:02:54.709 --> 01:02:55.710
What?

940
01:02:58.838 --> 01:03:01.174
I got to be with someone far too good for me,

941
01:03:02.801 --> 01:03:06.221
so even if I have to suffer or be punished for it someday,

942
01:03:06.763 --> 01:03:08.807
I don't care. So be it.

943
01:03:19.526 --> 01:03:21.069
Park Minjae is mine.

944
01:03:22.904 --> 01:03:25.031
I'm never letting anyone take you away from me.

945
01:03:27.200 --> 01:03:28.576
You're mine.

946
01:03:29.702 --> 01:03:31.454
No one can ever take you away from me.

947
01:03:35.125 --> 01:03:36.501
Have you been drinking?

948
01:03:36.584 --> 01:03:39.504
No. I didn't. I'm completely sober.

949
01:03:41.172 --> 01:03:42.173
[Minjae chuckles softly]

950
01:03:45.927 --> 01:03:47.220
I love you.

951
01:03:47.303 --> 01:03:49.305
[♪ music fades]

952
01:03:52.684 --> 01:03:54.060
[mouthing] Me too.

953
01:03:55.895 --> 01:03:57.188
-Hmm? -[Minjae] Hmm?

954
01:03:57.272 --> 01:03:59.065
[♪ gentle music builds]

955
01:03:59.149 --> 01:04:00.733
If you didn't hear it, never mind.

956
01:04:02.569 --> 01:04:03.570
I did.

957
01:04:06.531 --> 01:04:07.532
I love you.

958
01:04:12.954 --> 01:04:13.955
Me too.

959
01:04:28.428 --> 01:04:33.349
BETWEEN STEPS

960
01:04:33.433 --> 01:04:35.435
[♪ lively music playing]

961
01:05:09.469 --> 01:05:10.470
Turn a bit this way.

962
01:05:10.553 --> 01:05:12.222
I don't think you like me that much.

963
01:05:12.305 --> 01:05:13.306
-Hello. -[Minjae] Yes.

964
01:05:13.389 --> 01:05:14.766
[Sejin] Isn't she ridiculously pretty?

965
01:05:14.849 --> 01:05:16.809
I can't believe she's Lim Youjin's friend.

966
01:05:17.769 --> 01:05:20.605
And you'd still save Subin over me?

967
01:05:20.688 --> 01:05:24.234
But how could I set her up with that nutjob Kim Sejin?

968
01:05:24.317 --> 01:05:25.860
What? What are you doing here?

969
01:05:25.944 --> 01:05:29.447
[Sejin] I don't know why you're trying to get close with Minjae,

970
01:05:29.530 --> 01:05:33.034
but he's a completely different kind of person from you.

971
01:05:33.117 --> 01:05:34.827
Let's save that kiss for home.

972
01:05:34.911 --> 01:05:35.912
You're cute.
